{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready to drift with Crazy Carts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for a fun-filled drive with your carts? With relaxing and smooth gameplay, you can drive on chill maps or race with your friends, but remember that it will take some time to master the driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/c0c7cb059b44c4be8a5e2c08eb959b20.poster.avif?t=1765551621\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/c0c7cb059b44c4be8a5e2c08eb959b20.webm?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/c0c7cb059b44c4be8a5e2c08eb959b20.mp4?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race with your friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 8 friends on a different tracks. Overtake your friends and bump into them! Drift through the chaos and race to be the first to finish in this action-packed race. Prove you're the best Crazy Cart driver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/aea29faf5cb184315a5788b7f7cb53d4.poster.avif?t=1765551621\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/aea29faf5cb184315a5788b7f7cb53d4.webm?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/aea29faf5cb184315a5788b7f7cb53d4.mp4?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your cart and character!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique style by using different designs and models to become the coolest Crazy Cart driver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/132b2f82b5aa6739996e7d56f3324e2a.poster.avif?t=1765551621\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/132b2f82b5aa6739996e7d56f3324e2a.webm?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/132b2f82b5aa6739996e7d56f3324e2a.mp4?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We appreciate your support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If our game caught your interest, you can support us by adding it to your <strong>wishlist!</strong> This would make us incredibly happy and keep us motivated. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/3bff28a5c873882742478fdfa97f9fab.poster.avif?t=1765551621\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/3bff28a5c873882742478fdfa97f9fab.webm?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/3bff28a5c873882742478fdfa97f9fab.mp4?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wrecker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884390/f20d89969eac36bb6a6903684f355cacaeb5da0d.jpg"},{"name":"Elite Wrecker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco