bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your cart and character!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique style by using different designs and models to become the coolest Crazy Cart driver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/132b2f82b5aa6739996e7d56f3324e2a.poster.avif?t=1765551621\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/132b2f82b5aa6739996e7d56f3324e2a.webm?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/132b2f82b5aa6739996e7d56f3324e2a.mp4?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We appreciate your support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If our game caught your interest, you can support us by adding it to your <strong>wishlist!</strong> This would make us incredibly happy and keep us motivated. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/3bff28a5c873882742478fdfa97f9fab.poster.avif?t=1765551621\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/3bff28a5c873882742478fdfa97f9fab.webm?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884390/extras/3bff28a5c873882742478fdfa97f9fab.mp4?t=1765551621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Beaked Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"he